phases.content:
Add two helpers to apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/fs_utils.rs. (1) seed_state_if_absent(tiki_path: &Path) -> Result<bool, String>: if tiki_path/state.json exists, return Ok(false) WITHOUT writing (do NOT call write_fresh_state — it backs up + clobbers, fs_utils.rs:325-345); else create_dir_all(tiki_path) and atomic_write the EXACT canonical literal {
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "activeWork": {}
}
 (the same constant as fs_utils.rs:340) and return Ok(true). The state schema root is additionalProperties:false, so write EXACTLY {schemaVersion, activeWork} — no history/timestamps. (2) write_starter_gitignore(project_root: &Path) -> Result<bool, String>: skip (Ok(false)) if .gitignore exists; else write policy content as a const &str — IGNORE .tiki/journal.ndjson, .tiki/backups/, .tiki/*.broken.json, *.backup, node_modules/, target/, dist/; and COMMIT state.json/plans/releases/research by NOT ignoring them. Add unit tests using the existing harness (fs_utils.rs:391).
